  "details": "i i run a theater in vr right now i have  a prop microphone  in there and i noticed that the in the back were i have assess to all the lights , i cant here anyone on stage.\n\nso to compensate, what would be great is if the sdk had a script that worked in that if a player is in an area(is triggered box collider) or holding a specific object(linked to pickup scrpt) then there voice is mirrored over to a audio source in the scene so that the may talk show in Vrchat, do not have to worry about poor sound quality and packing everyone in to a small area just to here.",
